-    <main class="page-container"><a href="/HermeticDB/texts.html" class="back-link">← Return to Library</a><h1 class="title-large">Iamblichus: De Mysteriis</h1><div class="card-meta" style="margin-bottom:3rem">PRIMARY_SOURCE</div><div class="prose-content"><p>The definitive Neoplatonic defense of ritual magic (theurgy) against the rationalist critiques of Porphyry. Iamblichus argues that God is reached through ritual acts, not just philosophy.</p><div class="themes-container" style="margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border)"><span style="color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.9rem; margin-right:1rem">KEY THEMES:</span><a href="/HermeticDB/concepts/theurgy.html" class="theme-tag">Theurgy</a></div></div></main>
