-    <main class="page-container"><a href="/HermeticDB/texts.html" class="back-link">← Return to Library</a><h1 class="title-large">Picatrix (Ghayat al-Hakim)</h1><div class="card-meta" style="margin-bottom:3rem">PRIMARY_SOURCE</div><div class="prose-content"><p>A massive compendium of astral magic and talismanic lore. It attributes many of its operations to Hermes Trismegistus and describes the 'perfect nature' as a source of secret knowledge. The text provides detailed instructions on planetary correspondences, image magic, and the invocation of celestial spirits, forming the cornerstone of the operative Hermetic tradition in the Middle Ages and Renaissance.</p><div class="themes-container" style="margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border)"><span style="color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.9rem; margin-right:1rem">KEY THEMES:</span><a href="/HermeticDB/concepts/astral_magic.html" class="theme-tag">Astral Magic</a> <a href="/HermeticDB/concepts/sympatheia.html" class="theme-tag">Sympatheia</a> <a href="/HermeticDB/concepts/talismans.html" class="theme-tag">Talismans</a></div></div></main>
+    <main class="page-container"><a href="/HermeticDB/texts.html" class="back-link">← Return to Library</a><h1 class="title-large">Picatrix (Ghayat al-Hakim)</h1><div class="card-meta" style="margin-bottom:3rem">PRIMARY_SOURCE</div><div class="prose-content"><p>The <i>Picatrix</i> (Ghayat al-Hakim) is a massive Arabic manual of astral magic and talismans. It justifies magical operations through the Hermetic theory of <i><i>Sympatheia</i></i>, arguing that the mage can channel celestial influences by aligning terrestrial materials with planetary archetypes.</p><div class="themes-container" style="margin-top: 2rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border)"><span style="color:var(--text-muted); font-size:0.9rem; margin-right:1rem">KEY THEMES:</span><a href="/HermeticDB/concepts/astral_magic.html" class="theme-tag">Astral Magic</a> <a href="/HermeticDB/concepts/sympatheia.html" class="theme-tag">Sympatheia</a> <a href="/HermeticDB/concepts/talismans.html" class="theme-tag">Talismans</a> <a href="/HermeticDB/concepts/perfect_nature.html" class="theme-tag">Perfect Nature (Al-Tabi'a al-Tamma)</a> <a href="/HermeticDB/concepts/planetary_mansions.html" class="theme-tag">Planetary Mansions</a> <a href="/HermeticDB/concepts/suffumigation.html" class="theme-tag">Suffumigation</a></div></div></main>
