-    <main class="page-container"><a href="/HermeticDB/texts.html" class="back-link">← Return to Library</a><h1 class="title-large">The Emerald Tablet</h1><div class="card-meta" style="margin-bottom:3rem">PRIMARY_SOURCE</div><div class="prose-content"><p>The <i>Tabula Smaragdina</i> is the most famous text in the history of alchemy. Attributed to Hermes Trismegistus, it provides the cryptic formula for the creation of the Philosopher's Stone.</p>
